":{"id":"S10115","name":{"zh":"征讨南蛮","en":"Southern Campaign"},"year":"225","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10104","city":"CS1016","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[51,27,73,82,87,62],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"7450","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1015205","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1016","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[51,27,73,82,87,62],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"7450","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1015205","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1016","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[51,27,73,82,87,62],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"7450","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1015205","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1016","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":3,"stats":[51,27,73,82,87,62],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"7450","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1015205","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ1000115","city":"CS1032","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":2,"stats":[51,27,73,82,87,62],"title":-1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"7450","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1015205","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1016","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[51,27,73,82,87,62],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"1350","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1015205","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1016","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[51,27,73,82,87,62],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"1350","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1015205","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"魏国官臣，夏侯尚之子，大将军曹爽的表弟。少年有名望，仪表出众，时人称为“朗朗如日月之入怀”。精通玄学，被誉为“四聪”之一，他和何晏等人开创魏晋玄学的先河，是早期的玄学领袖。后任征西将军、假节，都督雍州、凉州军事。司马家族掌权后，与李丰等人奉命谋害司马师。但因其早有防备而导致消息泄露，与参与此事的魏臣皆被处刑。","tc":"魏國官臣，夏侯尚之子，大將軍曹爽的表弟。少年有名望，儀表出眾，時人稱為“朗朗如日月之入懷”。精通玄學，被譽為“四聰”之一，他和何晏等人開創魏晉玄學的先河，是早期的玄學領袖。后任征西將軍、假節，都督雍州、涼州軍事。司馬家族掌權后，與李豐等人奉命謀害司馬師。但因其早有防備而導致消息泄露，與參與此事的魏臣皆被處刑。","en":"An official of Wei, son of Xiahou Shang, and cousin of Grand General Cao Shuang. Renowned from a young age for his distinguished bearing, contemporary admirers described him as ‘radiant as the sun and moon in one's embrace.’ A master of metaphysical thought, he was celebrated as one of the ‘Four Brilliant Minds’ and co-founded the Wei-Jin school of metaphysics with He Yan and others, serving as an early leader of the movement. He later served as West Off. (conquest) with Staff of Authority, and as Viceroy overseeing the military affairs of Yong and Liang Provinces. After the Sima family seized power, he received secret orders to assassinate Sima Shi along with Li Feng and others. However, Sima Shi's vigilance led to the plot leaking out, and he along with all the Wei officials involved were executed.","jp":"魏の臣下。夏侯尚の子で、大将軍・曹爽の従弟。若くして名望があり、優れた風貌から当時の人々に「朗朗として日月の懐に入るが如し」と称された。玄学に通じ、「四聡」の一人に数えられ、何晏らと共に魏晋玄学の先駆けとなり、初期の玄学の領袖となった。後に征西将軍・仮節となり、雍州・涼州の諸軍事を都督した。司馬家族が権力を握った後、李豊らと共に命を受けて司馬師の謀殺を図るも、事前に警戒されていたため計画が露見し、関与した魏の臣下たちと共に処刑された。","kr":"위나라의 관리이자 하후상의 아들이며, 대장군 조상의 이종사촌 아우이다. 어려서부터 명망이 높고 용모가 비범하여 당시 사람들은 '가슴에 해와 달을 품은 듯 환하다'라고 일컬었다. 현학에 정통하여 '사총(四聰)' 중 한 사람으로 꼽혔으며, 하안 등과 함께 위진 현학의 효시를 열어 초기 현학의 영수가 되었다. 훗날 정서장군과 가절에 제수되어 옹주와 양주의 군사를 도독했다. 사마 가문이 권력을 장악한 뒤에는 밀명을 받아 이풍 등과 함께 사마사를 시해하려 했다. 그러나 사마사가 이미 대비하고 있어 계획이 누설되었고, 거사에 가담했던 위나라 신하들과 함께 모두 처형되었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10453","remark":"","surname":"夏侯","surnameTc":"夏侯","surnameEn":"Xiahou","surnameJp":"夏侯","surnameKr":"하후","surnameOther":"","name":"玄","nameTc":"玄","nameEn":"Xuan","nameJp":"玄","nameKr":"현","nameOther":"","word":"太初","wordTc":"太初","wordEn":"Taichu","wordJp":"太初","wordKr":"태초","wordOther":"","icon":"夏侯玄","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"222","city":"CS1016","gender":"0","rule":"51","force":"27","wise":"73","politics":"82","charm":"87","will":"62","ruleTalent":"4","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"11","charmTalent":"12","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"8/8/8/8/8/73/32/8","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"1000101;1001105","warSoulPoint":"2600","battleSoulPoint":"700","debateSoulPoint":"5300","strategy":"1004108;1007315","strategy2":"1004801","professions":"1/0/0/1/1/0/0/3/2/3/1/1/0/1/0/2/1/4/1/4/0/1/1/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"13","loyalty":"0","reputation":"1350","evaluate":"6000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"208","show":"222","death":"254","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"1","weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1015205","helmet":"WP1028305","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"2/1;58/1;12/1;31/1;27/1;42/1;41/1;19/2;33/2;69/0","father":"WJ10398/0","mother":"","children":"","family":"WJ1015615/100","mo